        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Bō: Path of the Teal Lotus",
        "extract": "Bō: Path of the Teal Lotus is an action-adventure platform game developed by Squid Shock Studios and published by Humble Games, and published by Raredrop Games on home consoles. It was released on 17 July 2024, for Microsoft Windows, Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X/S. It was the final game Humble Games published before effectively being closed on 23 July.",
